 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">You&apos;ve exceeded the maximum keycap engraving length. Please revise your entry.</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div *ngIf="keycap.isGen3()">\n\t<p class="small-caps text-blue" style="margin-bottom: 3px;">Formatting</p>\n\t<div class="row no-margin">\n\t\t<div class="col-4">\n\t\t\t<button test-id="textAlignLeftClick" class="white block" [ngClass]="{\'active\':keycap.textAlign===\'left\'}"\n\t\t\t\t\t(click)="keycap.textAlign=\'left\'">\n\t\t\t\t<i class="fal fa-align-left"></i></button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class="col-4">\n\t\t\t<button test-id="textAlignCenterClick" class="white block" [ngClass]="{\'active\':keycap.textAlign===\'center\'}"\n\t\t\t\t\t(click)="keycap.textAlign=\'center\'">\n\t\t\t\t<i class="fal fa-align-center"></i></button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class="col-4">\n\t\t\t<button test-id="textAlignRightClick" class="white block" [ngClass]="{\'active\':keycap.textAlign===\'right\'}"\n\t\t\t\t\t(click)="keycap.textAlign=\'right\'">\n\t\t\t\t<i class="fal fa-align-right"></i></button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="row no-margin" *ngIf="keycap.icon > 0 && keycap.topLine">\n\t\t<div class="col-6">\n\t\t\t<button test-id="positionLeftClick" class="white block" [ngClass]="{\'active\':keycap.position===\'left\'}" title="Icon Left"\n\t\t\t\t\t(click)="toggleSymbolPosition(\'left\')">\n\t\t\t\t<i class="fal fa-circle"></i>Icon Left</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class="col-6">\n\t\t\t<button test-id="positionRightClick" class="white block" [ngClass]="{\'active\':keycap.position===\'right\'}" title="Icon Ridght"\n\t\t\t\t\t(click)="toggleSymbolPosition(\'right\')"> Icon Right <i class="fal fa-circle"></i></button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<label id="largetext" class="animate-show" *ngIf="!keycap.isChinese()">\n\t\t<input test-id="keycapHasLargeTextCheckbox" type="checkbox" [(ngModel)]="keycap.isLargeText"\n\t\t\t   (ngModelChange)="checkLength(true);checkLength(false);"> Large Text </label>\n</div>\n<div class="half-padding-top